<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">The <span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">PIMMUR</span> Principles: Ensuring Validity in Collective Behavior of LLM Societies</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Jiaxu Zhou   Jen-tse Huang
</span><span id="id2" class="ltx_note ltx_note_frontmatter ltx_thanks_contribution ltx_role_thanks"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">†</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">†</sup><span class="ltx_note_type">thanks: </span>Jiaxu Zhou and Jen-tse Huang contributed equally to this work.</span></span></span></span>
